SUMMARY:Special Event: Maddi Mays
LOCATION:Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:Maddi Mays is an LA based stand-up comic\, originally from Hous
 ton\, TX. She performs all over the country and has opened for Kam Patterso
 n\, Marlon Wayans\, Ralph Barbosa\, Mandal\, Ken Flores\, and more. She was
  a featured performer at the 2024 Netflix Is A Joke Festival and more recen
 tly performed in the 2025 New York Comedy Festival. Online\, Mays has gener
 ated millions of views across her stand-up clips\, podcast appearances\, an
 d original sketches. She is also a recurring guest host on Jaime Garcia and
  Ralph Barbosa’s FatFish Podcast\, where her quick wit and distinctive co
 medic voice have made her a fan favorite. Before establishing herself in co
 medy\, Mays built an accomplished career in costume design\, illustration\,
  and styling for television\, film\, and music videos. Her credits include 
 Hulu’s Dollface and NBC Peacock’s Bust Down\, for which she also create
 d the series logo. Her visual artwork has been licensed and featured throug
 hout episodes of HBO’s PAUSE with Sam Jay.\n\nCouples Package includes:\n
 \n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratu
 ity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent custom
 ers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to oth
 er patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-
 event-maddi-mays/
